  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/10/40/050" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">10.40.050 Issuance of Permit.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list" dir="ltr"><li><strong>A.&nbsp;</strong>No permit requiring an erosion, sediment and pollutant control plan will be issued until the plan is approved.</li><li><strong>B.&nbsp;</strong>As a condition of permit issuance, the responsible party must agree to allow all inspections to be conducted.</li><li><strong>C.&nbsp;</strong>Where a bond, letter of credit or other guarantee is required, the permit will not be issued until the bond or guarantee has been obtained and approved.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-61f99e85a76267e2b9c66c0132db3de4e2d39d96dc047c71a3c47971a217d491">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
