<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/10/40/070" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">10.40.070 Cancellation of Permit or Expiration of Permit.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>The City Administrator may require that all denuded soil on the site be permanently stabilized before a permit is cancelled or expires.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-616b13bcd5804cea2be7014f03e4b3cfdd4fd13fd9c3c2f1669930b850f05cee">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
